      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do I want to sleep here (and block the PD state machine) for potentially hundreds of milliseconds ?\nmaybe this is the easiest solution (to avoid increasing PD_POWER_SUPPLY_TURN_ON_DELAY) but what if we just have a deferred function checking the transition happened before the turn-on delay ?",
