      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-10-18T19:30:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we have a choice, we can\u0027t send PS_RDY until the voltage has actually transitioned, so we need to block here. I also considered using task sleep / wake, which avoids the 10ms imprecision / needless wakes, but it gets slightly dirty because this is a PD task sleeping, so we need to add / steal an event from PD_EVENT space.",
